 of the Index. If the Fund cannot invest directly in the companies that constitute the Index, it may gain exposure by using other investments such as depositary receipts, derivatives or funds.The Fund may invest up to 35% of its assets in securities from a single issuer during exceptional market conditions.The Fund may invest up to 10% of its assets in total return swaps and contracts for difference.The Fund may invest up to 10% of its assets in other funds, including HSBC funds.See the Prospectus for a full description of the investment objectives and derivative usage.\nExchange information\nListing date\n\t\n07 Dec 2009\n\n\nSEDOL\n\t\nB4KTPN2\n\n\nTrading currency\n\t\nEUR\n\n\nReuters RIC code\n\t\nH50E.PA\n\n\niNAV Bloomberg ticker\n\t\n50EEURIV\n\n\niNAV Reut",
